    rdfs:comment "The realization functor rho applied to id_SubjectObjectPlane: the identity RealizationTransport at rho(crs:SubjectObjectPlane) = crs:carrier_SubjectObjectPlane (prim:transportDom = prim:transportCod = crs:carrier_SubjectObjectPlane, prim:isTransportIdentity true), so rho preserves identities at this object and SP1's q_functor_identity stays total over the merged graph." .

