    rdfs:label "Hom(-, SubjectPredicatePlane)" ;
    rdfs:comment "The representable presheaf Hom(-, crs:SubjectPredicatePlane) — the image of the (pi_S,pi_P) role-pair plane that drops the Object role (geometers.ttl T6) under the Yoneda embedding yo, carrying its Yoneda point prim:yonedaPoint crs:id_SubjectPredicatePlane (the identity element of Hom(crs:SubjectPredicatePlane, crs:SubjectPredicatePlane)). It puts crs:SubjectPredicatePlane in the object image of yo so SP1's prim:YonedaShape, which targets it once T11 makes it rdfs:subClassOf* prim:FormalType, stays green." .

crs:id_SubjectPredicatePlane a prim:IdentityArrow ;
    prim:arrowDom crs:SubjectPredicatePlane ;
    prim:arrowCod crs:SubjectPredicatePlane ;
    rdfs:label "id_SubjectPredicatePlane" ;
    rdfs:comment "The identity morphism id at crs:SubjectPredicatePlane (the (pi_S,pi_P) role-pair plane that drops the Object role (geometers.ttl T6)) — prim:arrowDom = prim:arrowCod = crs:SubjectPredicatePlane, the unit of arrow composition at this object and the reflexive Yoneda point of Hom(-, crs:SubjectPredicatePlane), keeping SP1's thin formal category total over the new object." .

